From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BlenderDesign Certification <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 17:18:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] Harden interactive addon transport

Restore bounded client accounting, fair accept/write budgets, chunked non-blocking responses, deferred JSON normalization, and defensive socket cleanup for the interactive Blender add-on.
